thub.com/godotengine/godot/tree/b159f6a6bc0f079ad46ca0d58957f917301e3162)) (4 days ago commit)\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev, win11\n\n### Issue description\n\nsee [compressed_texture.h](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/compressed_texture.h), there are no overrides of `*mipmap*` methods in there, so base methods are called: [Texture2D::has_mipmaps()](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/scene/resources/texture.cpp); which will return 0/false\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nreproducing code:\n\n```gdscript\nvar texture: CompressedTexture2D = preload(\"res://image.png\")\nprint(texture.has_mipmaps()) # return false\n# or:\nprint(texture.get_mipmap_count()) # returns 0\n\n# now its image:\nvar image: Image = texture.get_image()\nprint(image.has_mipmaps()) # return true\n# or:\nprint(image.get_mipmap_count()) # returns non-zero (in my case it was 6)\n```\n\n(make sure the texture has `mipmaps/generate=true`)\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.githu